title: Headlamp Switch Default to Auto Disable (Remember Last Position)
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Headlamp Switch Default to Auto Disable (Remember
  Last Position)
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Lighting] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Prevent headlamp
  switch from defaulting to Auto position]

  Headlamp switch retains the last position used across key cycles instead of resetting
  to Auto on startup.'
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-74-01
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature: HeadlampPosAtIgnOn_Cfg (HPAIOC)
recipe_version: '1.1'
